      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0",
      "artist": "Ken Lund from Reno, Nevada, USA",
      "description": "The Catalina Casino is located in Avalon on Catalina Island off the coast of Los Angeles. It is the most recognisable landmark in the City of Avalon. It contains a theatre, a ballroom and a museum. The Catalina Casino gets its name from the Italian language, where “casino” means a gathering place. There is no gambling at this facility\nen.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catalina_Casino\n\nen.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Text_of_Creative_Commons_...",
